# Build context excludes — keep the image build reproducible and small. In particular node_modules
# is excluded so `COPY . .` never clobbers the clean `npm ci` tree with the host's (Windows) one.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.vite
coverage
**/coverage
data
**/data
playwright-report
test-results
.git
.github
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
